[[File:Salve amulet(ei) detail.png|left|150px]]
The '''Salve amulet(ei)''' is the enchanted and imbued form of the [[salve amulet]], granting a 20% increase in the wearer's accuracy and damage for [[melee]], [[ranged]], and [[magic]] when fighting [[Undead (attribute)|undead monsters]].

The salve amulet's bonuses against the undead '''do not''' stack with the [[black mask]] and [[Slayer helmet|slayer helmet's]] on-task bonuses; wearing both will only apply the bonuses of the salve amulet (ei). The salve amulet also '''does not''' have an effect on the [[dwarf multicannon]]'s accuracy.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1297156273645985793|date=22 August 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/106099|archivedate=22 August 2020|quote=Yes, boosts that apply to any target will help with the cannon. The boosts that tend not to help are the target-specific ones, e.g. boosts that require the target to be undead or require it to be your Slayer assignment.}} However, the bonuses of [[Void Knight equipment]] '''do''' stack with the salve amulet. Additionally, the amulet's effects apply to all targets when using multi-hitting melee weapons in a [[multicombat area]], such as the [[Scythe of Vitur]] and the [[special attack]] of the [[dragon 2h sword]], but not for multi-hitting magic and ranged attacks (ex. [[Chinchompa (weapon)|chinchompas]] and [[burst spells]]).

As the amulet is untradeable and does not [[(broken)|break]], it will always be kept on PvP death in the [[Wilderness]].

